				"Tier 3 Villagers using Tier 2  Seals of Approval, and so on."
				"Seals of Approval can be bought from level 5 Villagers."
				""
				"&6Tier 4 Villagers are picky and will require the most advanced and extravagant meals. There is only 1 Villager from Tier 5. Getting this Villager to max level will complete half of the end objective.&r"
