		{
			dependencies: ["364B6665BE417076"]
			description: [
				"As a Franchisee from The Company, your job is to ship food to your Overlords. You will need to work in conjunction with Villagers to provide your Employer with their requests as their lvl 5 trades feature exclusive items required to ship packages to The Company."
				""
				"&4This Questline is for completionists and is optional, although The Company will not like that. If you want to go on the path to becoming &6Employee of the Month&4, you will still need Villagers."
